{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_page", "label": "Konfiguration (HOCON)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_three_layers", "label": "Drei Aufl\u00f6sungsschichten (Code > Nutzer-Config > Reference)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jede Schicht \u00fcberlagert die vorherige, pro Feld statt pro Block; ein undefined im Code bedeutet 'nicht gesetzt' und f\u00e4llt durch."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_reference_conf_constant", "label": "REFERENCE_CONF (src/config/reference.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_application_conf", "label": "application.conf", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_default_location_rule", "label": "Wo der eingebaute Default steht", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Options-Defaults stehen neben ihrem Feld in der passenden XOptions.ts, alles andere in einer Constants.ts (src/<subsystem>/ oder src/util/) \u2014 ein reference.conf-Blatt und sein Code-Fallback sind damit immer genau zwei Dateien, und die zweite ist nach der ersten benannt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_includes_not_supported", "label": "include-Direktiven werden abgelehnt", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein aufgel\u00f6stes include \u00fcberlie\u00dfe demjenigen, der die Config schreibt, die Wahl der gelesenen Pfade \u2014 relativ zu einer Wurzel, die der Parser nicht kennen kann. Zusammenf\u00fchren im Code (Config.parseFile + merge) bel\u00e4sst die Wahl beim Aufrufer; der Parser zitiert Zeile und Ziel."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_reserved_keys", "label": "Reservierte Schl\u00fcssel (__proto__, constructor, prototype)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Schl\u00fcsselpfad expandiert auf ein einfaches Objekt; eine Zuweisung an __proto__ schriebe in den Objekt-Prototypen und k\u00f6nnte das Verhalten jedes Objekts im Prozess \u00e4ndern. Die Pr\u00fcfung vergleicht exakt, \u00e4hnlich aussehende Schl\u00fcssel bleiben unproblematisch."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_own_keys_only", "label": "Lesend sind nur eigene Schl\u00fcssel sichtbar", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Schreibseite sichern drei abgelehnte Namen, die Leseseite ist positiv abgesichert, weil Object.prototype ein Dutzend weitere Member hat und eine Liste nie hinterherk\u00e4me; ein eigener Schl\u00fcssel \u00fcberdeckt den geerbten Member weiterhin."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_optionserror", "label": "OptionsError", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nennt Feld und Erwartung; bei Broker-Aktoren aus preStart nach der Pflichtfeld-Pr\u00fcfung, bei Nicht-Broker-Konsumenten aus dem Konstruktor."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_configerror", "label": "ConfigError", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_brokeroptionserror", "label": "BrokerOptionsError", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_validation_at_consume_time", "label": "Validierung einmal, zur Consume-Zeit, auf den gemergten Settings", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Weil die Pr\u00fcfung auf dem gemergten Ergebnis l\u00e4uft, gelten dieselben Regeln, egal wie ein Wert ankam \u2014 Builder, Plain-Objekt oder HOCON \u2014 und Cross-Field-Regeln sehen die finalen Werte."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_redacturlcredentials", "label": "redactUrlCredentials (maskierte Zugangsdaten)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jede URL-Regel ersetzt die Userinfo durch *** in Meldung und OptionsError.value, weil eine abgelehnte Broker-URL auf ERROR geloggt wird und ein Passwort im Log-Aggregator rotiert werden muss. Sonst wird der Wert nicht angefasst \u2014 keine Normalisierung."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_remote_tls_enabled", "label": "remote.tls.enabled (gelesen, nicht umgesetzt)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "true aktiviert kein TLS, sondern erzeugt eine Startup-WARN, damit ein ignoriertes Security-Setting in den Logs auftaucht (#591); Verschl\u00fcsselung ist #941. Ein Tippfehler wirft ConfigError, weil die nachsichtige Lesart den Node auf Klartext stehen lie\u00dfe, w\u00e4hrend die Config TLS sagt. Bei eigenem Transport bleibt der Key ungelesen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_max_gossip_bytes", "label": "distributed-data.max-gossip-bytes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Wird immer auf remote.max-frame-bytes heruntergeschnitten, weil die Fehlerbilder unvergleichbar sind: ein Frame \u00fcber dem Wire-Cap kostet die komplette Peer-Verbindung, ein Budget verteilt denselben Zustand nur \u00fcber mehr Ticks. Ein Key, dessen eigene Kodierung das Budget \u00fcberschreitet, wird \u00fcbersprungen, gez\u00e4hlt \u2014 und konvergiert nicht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_quorum_request_caps", "label": "max-pending-quorum-requests / max-quorum-timeout", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jeder offene Quorum-Request h\u00e4lt Promise, Timer und Ziel-Set bis zur Deadline; ablehnen macht aus einem sp\u00e4teren Timeout-Sturm sofortige Fehler, die den Knopf beim Namen nennen. Das Timeout-Cap begrenzt die andere Achse, damit ein stundenlanges timeoutMs nicht das Budget parkt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_dead_letters_store", "label": "dead-letters.store (off / metrics / memory / persistent)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Geordnet danach, wie viel aufbewahrt wird; eine leere persistence-id leitet den Stream aus dem Systemnamen ab, damit zwei Systeme mit gemeinsamem Journal getrennte Queues behalten."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_sharding_keys", "label": "actor-ts.sharding-Keys", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gelten f\u00fcr jeden Sharded Type des Nodes und liegen unter dem, was sharding.start explizit \u00fcbergibt; ein Setting f\u00fcr genau einen Typ geh\u00f6rt in den Builder, die Config-Datei ist die node-weite Grundeinstellung ohne Rebuild. Die polymorphen Optionen haben keine HOCON-Form."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_env_substitution", "label": "Environment-Substitution ${?ENV} / ${ENV}", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Weg, Credentials aus application.conf herauszuhalten und die Bind-Adresse komplett aus dem Code zu ziehen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_durations_and_sizes", "label": "HOCON-Durations und -Sizes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Einheiten ns/us/ms/s/m/h/d und B/K/M/G/T (bin\u00e4r, 1024); nackte Zahlen parst HOCON als Zahlen, Duration-Keys brauchen also eine explizite Einheit."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_plugin_keys_fully_qualified", "label": "Plugin-Keys sind voll qualifizierte Pfade", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Plugin-Key zeigt auf den Config-Abschnitt, in dem die Settings dieses Plugins leben; Kurznamen wie \"sqlite\" werden nicht aufgel\u00f6st."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_three_layers", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_reference_conf_constant", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_three_layers", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_application_conf", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_default_location_rule", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_reference_conf_constant", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_includes_not_supported", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_application_conf", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_own_keys_only", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_reserved_keys", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_validation_at_consume_time", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_optionserror", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_optionserror", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_configerror", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_optionserror", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_brokeroptionserror", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/reference/configuration.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_redacturlcredentials", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_reference_configuration_optionserror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/conten